                        "entry_id": "2d1e9e77-1f24-3d70-ae8a-61a6e28af9f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A unit of volume, in the Imperial and U.S. customary systems, ¹⁄₆₀ fluid drachm. Approximately equal to 1 drop, 62 μL or 0.9 grain (weight) of water."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
