                                "sense_id": "af83fc60-ab6f-3e35-8a19-56980f11e314",
                                "text": "He thanked me with a smiling nod, measured out a few minims of the red tincture and added one of the powders."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b054c0f7-d3d2-3c96-89b1-4eca2ed496f3",
                        "entry_id": "2d1e9e77-1f24-3d70-ae8a-61a6e28af9f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A short vertical stroke used in handwriting."
